# ProBAN is a Unix / FreeBSD (OPNsense) plugin. Enforce LF line endings
# everywhere so the rc.d script, shell supervisor, python, and PHP never
# end up with CRLF (which breaks shebangs and rc scripts) — regardless of
# the platform the repo is cloned or edited on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# binary assets — leave untouched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
